{"version":1,"content":"<p>陸劇95花田曦薇憑《嫁金釵》「分身」飾演真假千金而獲讚演技大躍進，人氣極高的她無縫入組一劇接一劇，剛與魏大勛拍畢時裝劇，已官宣將偕男神宋威龍合演古裝劇，被指登上95頂流小花之頂，連趙露思這位扛劇花旦亦地位危危乎。</p><p>趙露思不得不轉型，前日以主演</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T16:24:31.741300+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T16:00:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T16:17:40.656028+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T16:17:40.656028+00:00","content_hash":"496910980d8759902ee0fd04fcd43df1bcc407fecd0b46c36da83eda75d46f04","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}